    "detailed_description": "<strong>In the shattered continent of Aethria, an abyssal corrosion from deep underground is quietly spreading. This dark energy from ancient times distorts everything and transforms living beings into bloodthirsty monsters. The only thing that can resist the corrosion is the magic gems scattered around the world - they are ancient relics, containing pure and uncontaminated magic.<br>These gems can not only give the power to control elements and strengthen the body, but also create the ultimate weapon against the abyss through synthesis.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693590/extras/f310376851d837bccc74fd16bbe36af7.webp?t=1749288482\" width=615 height=58 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693590/extras/126548f5051d1f7437be48dfd35dd80c.poster.avif?t=1749288482\" width=614 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693590/extras/126548f5051d1f7437be48dfd35dd80c.webm?t=1749288482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693590/extras/126548f5051d1f7437be48dfd35dd80c.mp4?t=1749288482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Classic turn-based combat allows for careful planning. No penalties for failure\u2014retry and refine your gem combos until you perfect your build.  </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693590/extras/6df5aa80ebbd3fd7e482b2afbc70cde0.webp?t=1749288482\" width=615 height=58 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693590/extras/a57909ccc8042fa3609a8be30f41d6c9.poster.avif?t=1749288482\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693590/extras/a57909ccc8042fa3609a8be30f41d6c9.webm?t=1749288482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693590/extras/a57909ccc8042fa3609a8be30f41d6c9.mp4?t=1749288482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Defeat enemies to collect coins and elemental gems (fire, frost, lightning, etc.). Mix and match hundreds of gems to create explosive, sustained, or unique playstyles.  </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693590/extras/83b8153012ce1aea0024d1e8b2608490.webp?t=1749288482\" width=615 height=58 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693590/extras/1fe880cdafa6c67ac9fa250299231772.poster.avif?t=1749288482\" width=614 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693590/extras/1fe880cdafa6c67ac9fa250299231772.webm?t=1749288482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693590/extras/1fe880cdafa6c67ac9fa250299231772.mp4?t=1749288482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Face 40+ enemies with unique mechanics (gem devouring, evolution, damage reflection, etc.). Counter them with 400+ gems, preset decks, and relics to unleash devastating combos.</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>In the shattered continent of Aethria, an abyssal corrosion from deep underground is quietly spreading. This dark energy from ancient times distorts everything and transforms living beings into bloodthirsty monsters. The only thing that can resist the corrosion is the magic gems scattered around the world - they are ancient relics, containing pure and uncontaminated magic.<br>These gems can not only give the power to control elements and strengthen the body, but also create the ultimate weapon against the abyss through synthesis.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693590/extras/f310376851d837bccc74fd16bbe36af7.webp?t=1749288482\" width=615 height=58 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693590/extras/126548f5051d1f7437be48dfd35dd80c.poster.avif?t=1749288482\" width=614 height=302 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693590/extras/126548f5051d1f7437be48dfd35dd80c.webm?t=1749288482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693590/extras/126548f5051d1f7437be48dfd35dd80c.mp4?t=1749288482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Classic turn-based combat allows for careful planning. No penalties for failure\u2014retry and refine your gem combos until you perfect your build.  </strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693590/extras/6df5aa80ebbd3fd7e482b2afbc70cde0.webp?t=1749288482\" width=615 height=58 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693590/extras/a57909ccc8042fa3609a8be30f41d6c9.poster.avif?t=1749288482\" width=614 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693590/extras/a57909ccc8042fa3609a8be30f41d6c9.webm?t=1749288482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693590/extras/a57909ccc8042fa3609a8be30f41d6c9.mp4?t=1749288482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Defeat enemies to collect coins and elemental gems (fire, frost, lightning, etc.). Mix and match hundreds of gems to create explosive, sustained, or unique playstyles.  </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693590/extras/83b8153012ce1aea0024d1e8b2608490.webp?t=1749288482\" width=615 height=58 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693590/extras/1fe880cdafa6c67ac9fa250299231772.poster.avif?t=1749288482\" width=614 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693590/extras/1fe880cdafa6c67ac9fa250299231772.webm?t=1749288482\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3693590/extras/1fe880cdafa6c67ac9fa250299231772.mp4?t=1749288482\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Face 40+ enemies with unique mechanics (gem devouring, evolution, damage reflection, etc.). Counter them with 400+ gems, preset decks, and relics to unleash devastating combos.</strong>",
